<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Invicta yr share, div jumps.</title>
<headline>Invicta yr share, div jumps.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - fully diluted	 44.0	  vs 26.0</p>
<p>    - attrib		  53.0	  vs 32.0</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 15.0	  vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   30.65	 vs 15.92</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   28.76	 vs 21.16</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.89	  vs 4.35</p>
<p>    Interest paid	   4.17	  vs 1.84</p>
<p>    Turnover		  364.06	vs 233.01</p>
<p>Full name: Invicta Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - Directors will award capitalisation shares to shareholders registered on June 27. Terms of the award will be published on June 19.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
